    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Tired by the afternoon</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Positive</td><td>Breathless on stairs; no chest pain or palpitations</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Nausea and constipation since starting iron</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No bleeding, discharge, or urinary symptoms</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

